# The staging game server's ONLY env file: /home/bena/Documents/Algomancy-staging/staging.env
# (gitignored). Production's .env and tester.env are never read by staging, so
# no secret of production's reaches code that has not been reviewed yet.
PORT=5100
HOST=127.0.0.1
ALGO_PUBLIC_URL=https://staging.algomancy.online
# The card inspector asks production's rules app (read-only lookups).
ALGO_BOT_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# The judge box is OFF: on, its questions would land in production's answer
# logs and review queue, and spend production's LLM budget.
ALGO_JUDGE_OFF=1
# Deliberately unset: ALGO_BOT_TOKEN. Without it there is no Discord bot
# integration, so nothing staging does (a league note, a queue event) can reach
# a real player. ALGO_TESTER_TOKEN may be set to use deploy/admin.sh against :5100.
